{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmya8LUjc8NWFscm9S3M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My take: a קרן כספית is basically a fund that holds short, safe-ish stuff like מק\"מ and bank deposits. The page puts it at about **3.25% a year** for the daily one. My current account pays 0% and a 12-month deposit pays 1.8%. You can pull money out on any trading day with no lock-in, and the page itself says it's for \"כסף שצריך להישאר זמין: קרן חירום\". So yes, it fits money I might need soon. I'm fairly sure about that part. What decided it was that comparison box: 0% / 3.25% / 1.8%, with \"ביום מסחר\" on the fund. What I still don't know is what it actually costs me.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- **Top of the page:** heading \"קרן כספית\" and the subtitle about \"סיכון נמוך\". I read the first lines of \"מה זה\" and skimmed the rest. Too many words I skip: נאמן, מק\"מ, מפיץ, השעה היעודה.\n- **\"למה משתמשים בזה\":** first line was my exact question: \"קרן חירום… פודים בכל יום מסחר, בלי נעילה\". Good.\n- **Comparison box \"כמה מהר הכסף חוזר\":** big numbers. This is what clicked.\n- **\"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\":** heading only, kept scrolling.\n- **\"כמה זה עולה\":** looked for a number and found none. Every row says \"אין תקרה בחוק\" and has a pile of codes like MF-16, MF-20, BRK-16, BANK-18. I kept reading the same \"אין תקרה בחוק\" row after row hoping one would be different.\n- **\"מיסוי\":** looked at the three cards and saw \"25% מהרווח הריאלי\".\n- **\"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\":** caught \"אין ערבות של המדינה\" and \"אין ביטוח\", which made me a bit nervous.\n- **Bottom:** \"מונחים\" glossary, skimmed and skipped.\n\n**Skipped**\n- The fold \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\".\n- \"הצגת כל הבדיקות\".\n- The link \"כמה העמלות האלה עולות לאורך זמן\". That's actually my question, but it's a link, so I didn't open it.\n- All the \"הצגת החוקים והכללים\" links.\n- The grey notes under the boxes.\n\n**Where I hesitated**\n- **Cost:** the only fee number I saw was \"0.1%\" near \"דמי ניהול\" in the first section. I'm not sure if that's what I pay or something the bank gets (\"עמלת הפצה\").\n- **Tax:** 15% for the deposit vs 25% for the fund. At first glance the fund looked worse on tax. I didn't work out what \"ריאלי\" means.\n- **The 3.25%:** under the box it says \"לפני מס ועלויות\", so I'm not getting all of it.\n- **Which fund:** the page names no fund I'd recognise and doesn't tell me where to click first. So I know what it is, but not which one to buy or how.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** נאמן, מק\"מ, מפיץ, השעה היעודה, עמלת הפצה, רווח ריאלי / נומינלי, קרן נאמנות פטורה / חייבת, the codes MF-11, TXS-24, BANK-18 and so on."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4004,"cache_read_input_tokens":15183,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4004},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c7ae5ef-892c-4f11-abb8-d49e88eeffd5","uuid":"8ca9369e-c95b-44bc-bc69-573c02b0e685","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:18:06.020Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmya88L36nyYvJgn8KPh"}
